@ParkingApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059

### Request an OTP (new or existing user - backend decides purpose)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+9779800000000",
  "channel": "Sms"
}

### Verify OTP (routes to login or auto-registration server-side)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+9779800000000",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Complete onboarding - name/phone/email/gender/DOB (requires Bearer token; phone must be the OTP-verified number from the form)
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Prabin Khati",
  "phoneNumber": "+9779800000000",
  "email": "prabin@example.com",
  "gender": "Male",
  "dateOfBirth": "1998-06-15"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here"
}

### Logout (revokes the refresh token)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here"
}

### Get profile (requires Bearer token)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

### List my vehicles (requires Bearer token)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

### Vehicles init (dropdowns: vehicleTypes + vehicleCategories codes)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/vehicles/init
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

### Add a vehicle (requires Bearer token; vehicleCategory: 1=Scooter, 2=Motorcycle, 3=Car/Jeep/Van — must agree with vehicleType)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleType": 1,
  "vehicleCategory": 2,
  "name": "My fav bike",
  "vehicleNumber": "BA 1 JA 2345",
  "brand": "Bajaj",
  "model": "NS200",
  "color": "white"
}

### Licenses init (dropdown: license category codes K=1, A=2, A1=3, B=4)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/licenses/init
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

### Submit driving license (requires Bearer token; MinIO license-images/; starts Pending)
### NOTE: OPTIONAL for parking - booking and payment no longer check a license; it is kept for a future ride-rental feature.
# NOTE: multipart/form-data — fields licenseNumber, categories (comma-separated codes, e.g. "2,4"), expiryDate (yyyy-MM-dd), files front + back
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/licenses
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----licenseboundary

------licenseboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="licenseNumber"

01-234567
------licenseboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categories"

2
------licenseboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="expiryDate"

2030-05-20
------licenseboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="front"; filename="front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./front.jpg
------licenseboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="back"; filename="back.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./back.jpg
------licenseboundary--

### Get my driving license (requires Bearer token; 404 when nothing submitted)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/licenses
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

### BackOffice login (password based, no OTP)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userNameOrEmail": "SuperAdmin",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd"
}

### BackOffice: list riders (optional ?vehicleType)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/riders?vehicleType=TwoWheeler
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: list organizations (optional ?approvalStatus=Pending|Verified|UnderReview|Rejected)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/organizations?approvalStatus=Pending
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: list parking providers (oversight list, no approval flow)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/parking-providers
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### Create an organization (caller becomes Owner; ApprovalStatus=Pending until backoffice approves)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/organizations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

{
  "name": "Everest Mall",
  "registrationNumber": "PAN-2026-001",
  "contactNumber": "+977-1-4455667",
  "address": "Kamaladi, Kathmandu"
}

### List organizations I belong to (with my role in each)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/organizations
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Become an Individual parking provider (land owner / garage operator; one per account)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/parking-providers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

{
  "providerType": "Individual"
}

### Register an owned organization as a Company parking provider
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/parking-providers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

{
  "providerType": "Company",
  "organizationId": "paste-organization-id-here"
}

### List my parking providers (individual + companies I own)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/parking-providers
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Create a parking facility under a provider I own (ApprovalStatus=Pending until compliance verifies)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

{
  "providerId": "paste-provider-id-here",
  "name": "Baneshwor Parking",
  "description": "Ground floor, 24h, staff on site",
  "address": "Baneshwor, Kathmandu",
  "latitude": 27.6964,
  "longitude": 85.3247,
  "hasMarkedParkingLot": false,
  "twoWheelerOccupancy": 20,
  "fourWheelerOccupancy": 10,
  "landAreaSqM": 165.5
}

### Nearby parkings (no query: Verified + free lots within Nearby:NearMeRadiusKm, default 1 km, nearest first)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/nearby?latitude=27.6964&longitude=85.3247
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Nearby available spaces (same ring, only lots with a free TwoWheeler spot; 1=TwoWheeler, 2=FourWheeler)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/nearby?latitude=27.6964&longitude=85.3247&vehicleType=1
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Search parkings by name/address (no distance filter; lat/long only set the distance shown)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/nearby?latitude=27.6964&longitude=85.3247&query=Durbar Marg
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Rider: View details (Verified-only; description + gallery + per-type rate; optional ?vehicleType= hides a category the lot does not serve; reviews via /reviews)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/detail?vehicleType=1
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Book a spot - screen data: parking name + per-type occupancy + my vehicles the lot can take (requires Bearer token)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/bookings/init?facilityId=paste-facility-id-here
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Availability grid, today (hourly Kathmandu slots from the next local hour; 1=TwoWheeler, 2=FourWheeler; isBooked = full)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/availability?vehicleType=1
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Availability grid, a future day (yyyy-MM-dd, up to 7 days ahead)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/availability?vehicleType=1&date=2026-10-22
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Check one exact window before booking a multi-slot selection (UTC; both ends required)
### 2 PM-4 PM Kathmandu = 08:15-10:15 UTC (Nepal is UTC+5:45)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/availability?vehicleType=1&fromUtc=2026-10-22T08:15:00Z&toUtc=2026-10-22T10:15:00Z
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### List my facilities (with two/four-wheeler spot counts + approval status)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Facility detail with its spots (owner-only)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

### Update capacity (owner; Verified lots stage to pending for compliance, others update live)
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/capacity
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

{
  "twoWheelerOccupancy": 30,
  "fourWheelerOccupancy": 12,
  "landAreaSqM": 210
}

### BackOffice: approve/reject a pending capacity change (reason required when false)
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/capacity-approval
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

{
  "approve": true,
  "rejectionReason": null
}

### BackOffice: list facilities for compliance review (optional ?approvalStatus=Pending)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/facilities?approvalStatus=Pending
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: approve a facility (1=Pending, 2=Verified, 3=UnderReview, 4=Rejected; rejectionReason required when 4)
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/approval
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

{
  "approvalStatus": 2,
  "rejectionReason": null
}

### BackOffice: reject a facility (reason is shown to the owner in GET /facilities)
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/approval
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

{
  "approvalStatus": 4,
  "rejectionReason": "No visible signage and no marked entry."
}

### BackOffice: approve/reject an organization
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/organizations/paste-organization-id-here/approval
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

{
  "approvalStatus": 2,
  "rejectionReason": null
}

### BackOffice: list driving licenses for review (optional ?approvalStatus=Pending)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/licenses?approvalStatus=Pending
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: approve/reject a driving license (rider may resubmit only after rejection)
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/licenses/paste-license-id-here/approval
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

{
  "approvalStatus": 2,
  "rejectionReason": null
}

### BackOffice: facility detail incl. every spot (verifies counts + pricing)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/facilities/paste-facility-id-here
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: create a staff member (emails a generated password; the account is created either way)
### The response's passwordEmailSent=false means the mail did not go out - press Resend Invite below.
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/staff
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

{
  "fullName": "Ram Bahadur",
  "phoneNumber": "9800000000",
  "email": "ram@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1998-06-15",
  "gender": 1,
  "deviceName": "Redmi Note 12",
  "deviceBrand": "Xiaomi",
  "facilityId": "paste-facility-id-here"
}

### BackOffice: staff list (optional ?facilityId= &search= &status=all|active|inactive)
### mustChangePassword=true on a row = the invite is still outstanding, so the UI shows Resend Invite.
### It flips to false on the first login, once the staff member sets their own password.
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/staff?status=all
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: staff detail (mustChangePassword drives the Resend Invite button)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/staff/paste-staff-id-here
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: Resend Invite - the email never arrived
### Generates a NEW password (the original is only stored as a hash, so it cannot be re-sent) and emails it.
### 409 once the staff member has set their own password - use the reset below instead.
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/staff/paste-staff-id-here/resend-invite
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### BackOffice: reset a password (staff member lost it; rotates + re-forces the change)
PUT {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/backoffice/staff/paste-staff-id-here/password
Authorization: Bearer paste-backoffice-token-here

### Upload facility images (optional, MinIO-backed; more images = faster compliance review)
# NOTE: set Content-Type: multipart/form-data with file fields named "files" (REST Client sends files via $file variables in .http files)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/images
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----imageboundary

------imageboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="gate.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./gate.jpg
------imageboundary--

### Upload profile picture (single file, MinIO profile-images/; replaces previous)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/profile/picture
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----imageboundary

------imageboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="me.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./me.jpg
------imageboundary--

### Review a facility (verified facilities only, one review per rider)
POST {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-rider-token-here

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Easy entry, guard on site."
}

### List facility reviews (newest first, with aggregate rating)
GET {{ParkingApp_HostAddress}}/facilities/paste-facility-id-here/reviews
Authorization: Bearer paste-app-token-here

###